# Run 414 evidence archive — only README.md, summary.txt, and .gitignore are tracked.
# The harness is a read-only cross-section coverage verifier; it generates nothing under the
# repository tree. Any transient run output (summaries, extracted sections, self-test scratch
# copies) is written to a staging directory OUTSIDE the package tree (runner temp) and MUST NOT be
# committed. Only publish-safe OK/POSITIVE/NONE status lines appear in the tracked summary.
material/
node/
nodes/
logs/
data/
artifact-staging/
